WEBVTT

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.100
M-Min-chan...

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:33.820
What's this?

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:36.520
No one will interrupt us now. Rejoice.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:38.820
I'll give you the death you wished for.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.620
You still dare defy me?!

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:53.820
This book is...

00:01:55.770 --> 00:01:57.610
You came, Daddy?

00:01:57.610 --> 00:01:58.800
Am I still alive?

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.870
You silly goose. I'm always by your side.

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:07.770
Hello? Sorry for leaving in the middle.

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:10.810
Huh? A marketing presentation tomorrow?

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:18.110
The doctor said

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:21.910
you should rest up at home for a while.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:25.330
What will we play today, Daddy?

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:29.170
You see, Daddy draws pictures for work.

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:31.670
And today, I'll draw a picture book for you.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.160
What'll the story be?

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:35.830
Let's see... I think I'll 
write a superhero story.

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.260
A superhero?

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.130
The superhero... 
takes out cockroaches!

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:40.130
He takes out cockroaches,

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.220
Makes the shrimps
you hate so much go away!

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:43.300
makes the shrimps you hate so much go away.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:47.140
The superhero will chase away

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.460
I'm scared!

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:50.020
everything you're afraid of or hate.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.020
He'll beat them up.

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:10.130
Everything in this universe belongs to me!

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:12.220
None may stand in my way!

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:17.350
Now, then.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:21.230
I'll give you the death 
you've been waiting for.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.450
Nah, I can't die.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:25.090
Huh?

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:26.260
What was that?

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:28.840
I haven't resolved

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.270
a problem I created yet.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.520
Did you draw this, Min-chan?

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:35.010
Who is this?

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:36.690
Bad Daddy.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:39.360
Hey, hey. I'm the bad guy?

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:43.110
Ta-da! To celebrate my new 
work success in advance,

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.550
a special present to my family!

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:47.560
A two-seater? What's wrong with you?

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:48.670
Are you stupid?

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:52.480
What's wrong with fulfilling my dreams 
as a man with the money I earn myself?

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:54.920
That's only if things 
go well with your work!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.710
What about the debts we're yet to repay?

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.840
Besides, I've got stuff I want—

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:58.840
Shut up!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.290
Don't stand between a man and 
his dreams, you dumb broad!

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:04.970
This is Daddy as an evil king.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:07.440
What happens to me, then?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.980
I want the good Daddy to 
defeat the evil Daddy.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.260
You are me.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.990
The bad me lurking beside me!

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:26.620
Then what will you do, Superhero?

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.840
He might've had a stroke!

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.100
Hurry up and get the OR ready!

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:58.270
Don't fret, Min-chan.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:01.060
The doctors said there's still hope.

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:04.490
It's not certain that he'll 
never wake up again.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:07.600
Yeah, but why did this happen?

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:09.880
Your daddy worked too hard.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:12.300
Working eight part-time jobs

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:14.500
at once was clearly too much.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:16.280
Part-time jobs?

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:18.320
He said he was president of his own company.

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:20.790
He couldn't bring himself 
to tell you the truth, huh?

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:23.580
I'm sorry.

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.840
Thanks for filling in for 
me on that presentation.

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:29.670
We'll figure something out here, 
so stay by your family's side.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:31.890
As long as we have the documents...

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.320
I'm counting on you.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:38.860
Your daddy had a huge 
project stolen by someone.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.750
Once he realized, he did all he could

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:45.370
to convince people it was his idea,

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.830
but his cruel co-workers made 
him out to be the bad guy

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.440
and chased him out of the 
toilet seat business.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:52.180
And so, he lost his job and all his money.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:54.250
That's how it went, I'm told.

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:59.380
He was doing everything he 
could to get his job back.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.150
Even going door-to-door 
to sell toilet seats.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:05.280
He did his best and went to places 
nobody else wanted to go...

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.940
Even Russia and Africa.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:11.640
After your mother left, 
he started working even harder.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:16.670
Looking at him, my struggles felt trivial,

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:18.620
like they meant nothing at all.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:21.480
But, you know, shouldn't you clear up

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.610
Min-chan's misunderstanding?

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.390
Don't just shoulder everything 
yourself. Tell her the truth.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.380
I don't mind being criticized or hated.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:35.280
Besides, the superhero in Min-chan's heart

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:38.620
cannot give up and lose so easily.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.680
That's my pride as a father.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:45.300
<b>Pride</b>

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:45.300
<b>as a father</b>

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.480
Hello, mister!

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:53.800
I love Min-chan, and we're seeing—

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:56.890
Get lost right now. 
Or I'll make you.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.980
This is why I said we shouldn't tell him.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:02.090
I want to impress him with my sincerity!

00:07:02.090 --> 00:07:04.470
Don't go spouting crap about 
sincerity or impressing me!

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:07.360
You were happily eating your 
own snot until recently!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.580
Even if he's in a coma, try talking 
to him as much as you can.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.210
<i>He might have some sensation 
left in his brain.</i>

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:24.010
"The Great Emperor's three sons,

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:28.170
Rash, Greed, and Pride were 
defeated by the superhero.

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:30.790
The Great Emperor looked

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:33.380
to destroy the world in a fit of rage.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:36.390
The superhero took him 
on in a decisive battle,

00:07:36.730 --> 00:07:38.950
but the Great Emperor was so strong,

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:40.930
the superhero's counterattacks didn't work.

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:44.180
And... And then...

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.400
You stupid old man!

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:53.750
I finally get why you didn't 
tell me how the story ended.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:58.240
This world doesn't have any

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:01.790
superheroes who never lose!

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:05.280
I don't need

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.410
any invincible superheroes.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.760
Just stay with me, Daddy!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.260
If you do, I won't have 
anything to be afraid of!

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.180
We couldn't go to the beach 
before, so let's go now.

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:19.180
Let's play that game we 
once got hooked on again.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.090
Let's go that farm, too.

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:25.520
And let's stay together until you're old.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:28.230
Please wake up!

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.770
Open your eyes!

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.590
Watch me grow up!

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.290
You rotten old man!

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:36.700
When I grow up, I want to be

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:38.740
your superhero and protect you!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:49.590
<b>Twelfth Day as a Superhero
"Stay With Me, Daddy!"</b>

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.790
Where did that rotten old man go?

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.110
Min-chan!

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:24.760
We're out of toilet paper!

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:26.530
Keep it down!

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:29.250
Don't scream just because 
there's no toilet paper.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.480
Are you telling me to wipe with my hand?

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:32.910
And wash my face with that very 
hand? I'll do it, you know?

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:35.400
Please don't! Here, toilet paper.

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:38.120
And how long have you been 
stuck in there, anyway?

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:41.610
The doctor told you not to push 
too hard in the toilet, right?

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:44.910
"Or you'll collapse due to high 
blood pressure again," he said.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:49.070
Well, I went to buy fried 
bread for you this morning.

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:52.480
But I was in a rush, so I ended up 
taking into the toilet with me.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:52.270
<b>Fried Bread</b>

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.970
Don't take food into the toilet!

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:57.460
And lay off the oily stuff!

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:01.320
But the doctor told me to eat nutritious 
food once I got discharged.

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.540
You're eating too much, you pig!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.310
How long are you gonna sleep?

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:08.920
I'll kill you. I'll make you poop.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:11.860
Wait, this was all a delusion 
from when I was in a coma...

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:13.000
Wait, why are you alive?

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.630
This is no dream or flashback. It's reality.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.210
What? But you died, too!

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.510
Quit whining and take a dump!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:21.050
Shit! Don't make me poop 
without my permission!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:23.390
<b>Space Peace Republic Alliance Hero Committee</b>

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.600
Hey, you're the only one in the 
world taking a dump again.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:24.880
Go to whichever world you want.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.820
All these worlds you thought were fictional

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:30.390
actually existed as part of a multiverse.

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:32.110
You won't end this on a 
"it was all a dream" punchline!

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:34.250
I want a girlfriend this time for sure.

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:36.110
I'll defeat you, and...

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.780
Quit spouting crap, my evil alter-ego!

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:41.340
Oh, was this reality, too? I deserve 
an Oscar for my performance.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:45.410
Invite us all to a Kamen Girls concert, then!

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.290
Technical Magic My Compact! 
Technical Magic My Compact!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.410
I want a mask.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:50.170
Which world do you like best?

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:51.540
That...

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:52.890
That goes without saying!

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:54.920
The one where I'm together with Min-chan!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.790
Gross! Creepy!

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:59.090
Eat this! Totsushindou!

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.090
<b>Totsushindou</b>

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.810
Thank you very much!

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:04.460
The End.
